Model weights (downloaded by scripts/download_weights.py, not redistributed)
---------------------------------------------------------------------------
Stable Diffusion 1.5 (CreativeML OpenRAIL-M), LCM-LoRA, VGGT-Omega (gated,
FAIR Noncommercial), CogVideoX-Fun and TrajectoryCrafter, BLIP-2, the VBench
evaluation models (CLIP, DINO, ViCLIP, LAION aesthetic predictor), SEA-RAFT
and the I3D TorchScript of StyleGAN-V. Each is used under its own license.

